            %p
              The last step follows from observing that we have manifestly the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cech+nerve"} Cech nerve
              as before, but now of the underlying
              = succeed "s" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/topological+space"} topological space
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
