          .proof
            %h6#proof_6 Proof
            %p
              As
              %a{:href => "#LieGroupsDelooping"} above
              for Lie groups.
          %h4#CircleLienGroup
            Circle Lie
            = succeed "-groups" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi n
