                    %msubsup
                      %mi Ω
                      %mi cl
                      %mi n
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mo{:lspace => "verythinmathspace", :rspace => "0em"} −
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} U(1)[n]_{const} \stackrel{\simeq}{\to} [C^\infty(-,U(1)) \stackrel{d_{dR}}{\to} \cdots \stackrel{d_{dR}}{\to} \Omega^n_{cl}(-)]
              that factors this inclusion by the above fibration.
          %h4#FlatCoefficientsForDeloopedLieGroup
            Flat coefficients of
