              = succeed "." do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Cech+nerve"} Cech nerve
            %p
              It is a standard result of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/abelian+sheaf+cohomology"} abelian sheaf cohomology
              that such cocycles represent classes in de Rham cohomology.
            %p But for the record and since the details of this computation will show up again at some mildly subtle points in further discussion below, we spell this out in some detail.
            %p
              For
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi n
                    %mo =
                    %mn 1
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} n = 1
              and
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi n
                    %mo =
                    %mn 0
