                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{\flat}_{dR} \mathbf{B}[G_2 \to G_1]
              is as the one above, discarding the piece
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
