            %p
              Here the last item is well defined given the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/coequalizer"} coequalizer
              definition of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msubsup
                      %mi Ω
                      %mi vert
                      %mo •
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \Omega^\bullet_{vert}
              because
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi f
                    %mo ,
                    %msub
                      %mi η
                      %mi n
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (f,\eta_n)
              is a morphism of
              = succeed "s" do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/bundle"} bundle
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
