          %h4#CurvatureCharacteristicOnCircleNGroup
            The universal curvature characteristic on
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi B
                    %mi n
                  %mi U
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 1
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{B}^n U(1)
          %p
            We discuss presentations of
            %a{:href => "http://ncatlab.org/nlab/show/cohesive+(infinity%2C1)-topos#CurvatureCharacteristics"} universal curvature characteristics
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi B
                    %mi n
                  %mi U
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 1
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                  %mo →
                  %mo{:lspace => "0em", :rspace => "thinmathspace"} mthbf
                  %msub
                    %mo ♭
                    %mi dR
                  %msup
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi B
                    %mrow
                      %mi n
                      %mo +
                      %mn 1
                  %mi U
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                  %mn 1
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{B}^n U(1)\to \mthbf{\flat}_{dR}\mathbf{B}^{n+1} U(1)
            and
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %msup
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi B
                    %mi n
                  %mi ℝ
                  %mo →
                  %mo{:lspace => "0em", :rspace => "thinmathspace"} mthbf
                  %msub
                    %mo ♭
                    %mi dR
                  %msup
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                      %mi B
                    %mrow
                      %mi n
                      %mo +
                      %mn 1
                  %mi ℝ
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{B}^n \mathbb{R}\to \mthbf{\flat}_{dR}\mathbf{B}^{n+1} \mathbb{R}
            in
