                over that surface. The
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Bianchi+identity"} Bianchi identity
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi d
                      %msub
