          .proof
            %h6#proof_38 Proof
            %p
              For the first sequence, the characteristic class exact sequence, use
              %a{:href => "http://nlab.mathforge.org/nlab/show/cohesive+(infinity%2C1)-topos#CharacteristicClassExactSequence"} this general proposition
              from the discussion at
              %em
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cohesive+%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"} cohesive (∞,1)-topos
              \. This says that over the vanishing curvature form
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
